    "name": "Task Manager API (from server.test.js)",
    "description": "Aligned with `test/server.test.js` plus newer features: `?completed=`, `?order=` sort by `createdAt`, `priority` on tasks, and `GET /tasks/priority/:level`.\n\nSet **baseUrl** to `http://localhost:3000` (routes are `/tasks`, not under `/api`).",
